			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Regenerate build artifacts after Window namespace modularization\n\nRe-run the TypeScript compilation and ESBuild bundling pipeline to update the `Target/` directory following the decomposition of the `Window/Namespace` module. This commit introduces new factory artifacts for OutputChannel, Status Bar, Terminal, and Webview components, replacing the previous monolithic inline logic.\n\nThe `RouteManifest.ts` report is updated with a new generation timestamp and adjusted method counts reflecting the recent refactoring. All compiled JavaScript bundles and source maps are regenerated to ensure the extension host binary correctly resolves the new PascalCase directory hierarchy and imports across the gRPC service handlers.",
